# construction_v3 — Walkthrough & Proof of Work

## What Was Built

A complete **Target Binding Affinity Regression** module targeting EGFR (Lung Cancer) using a Hybrid Quantum-Classical ensemble. All 10 Python files pass AST syntax checks.

## Directory Structure

```
backend/construction_v3/
├── config.py                        # EGFR target, pIC50 scale, 20-qubit params
├── requirements.txt                 # All dependencies incl. mordred for 3D-MoRSE
├── app_v3.py                        # Streamlit dual-mode UI (35 KB)
├── services/
│   ├── feature_service_3d.py        # ETKDG v3 + MMFF94 + WHIM + Pearson filter
│   ├── classical_router.py          # XGBRegressor pIC50 inference
│   ├── nystrom_engine.py            # Nystrom kernel (SVR-adapted)
│   └── quantum_kernel_service.py   # 20-qubit QSVR two-mode engine
├── quantum/
│   ├── backends.py                  # Statevector + Shot fidelity backends
│   └── circuits.py                  # HEA 20-qubit fidelity circuit
├── training/
│   ├── train_xgb_regressor.py      # Auto-downloads ChEMBL + XGBoost + Optuna
│   └── train_qsvr.py               # 20-qubit Nystrom-QSVR training pipeline
└── checkpoints/                     # Auto-created on first import
```

## Key Design Decisions

| Component | V2 (Classification) | V3 (Regression) |
|-----------|---------------------|-----------------|
| Target | Tox21 NR-AR | EGFR (ChEMBL203) |
| Features | 2D Morgan + MACCS | 3D WHIM + AUTOCORR3D (20 orthogonal) |
| Feature Generation | RDKit 2D | ETKDG v3 + MMFF94 + Pearson filter |
| Core Model | SVC (classify) | SVR (continuous pIC50) |
| Output | P(toxic) ∈ [0,1] | pIC50 ∈ [4, 11] |
| Metric | Accuracy / AUC | Pearson R² / RMSE |

