## How to Use

```bash
# Step 1: Install dependencies (in existing venv)
pip install -r construction_v3/requirements.txt

# Step 2: Train XGBRegressor (~5-10 min, downloads ChEMBL data automatically)
cd backend/construction_v3
python training/train_xgb_regressor.py

# Step 3: Train QSVR (~30-180 min, checkpointed for resumability)
python training/train_qsvr.py

# Step 4: Launch App
streamlit run app_v3.py
```

